## Title: Daseeki Bags
## Notes: A standalone bag interface for WoW Classic Era.
## Author: Daseeki
## Category: Bags & Inventory
## X-License: MIT
## X-Curse-Project-ID: 1592410
## OptionalDeps: Daseeki-Core
## Interface: 11507, 11508, 11509
## Version: 2.0.0
## SavedVariables: DaseekiBags2DB, DaseekiBags2Data
##
## Daseeki-Bags 2.0 — clean rewrite. This v2.toc documents the intended 2.0
## load order for the fresh flat tree; it is NOT wired into the live addon yet
## (the shipping Daseeki-Bags.toc still loads the 1.x tree). Cutover in a later
## wave replaces Daseeki-Bags.toc with this file and deletes the 1.x sources.
##
## New SavedVariables (additive; coexist with the 1.x globals
## DaseekiBagsAccount / DaseekiBagsSets / DaseekiBagsMesh, which 2.0 reads
## READ-ONLY once at first load via migrate.lua and never writes):
##   DaseekiBags2DB   — settings (schema-versioned)
##   DaseekiBags2Data — inventory cache DB (owners graph; per-container identity)
##
core.lua          # shared ns runtime (Print/SafeCall/events/On-Fire bus) + lifecycle
store.lua         # SavedVariables layer: settings + inventory cache DB
capture.lua       # live scan on the 1.15 event surface (C_Container)
migrate.lua       # one-time read-only conversion of the 1.x SV
# --- W2 (UI) --- loads after Daseeki-Core (OptionalDeps) so DaseekiUI exists ---
borders.lua       # quality borders (loads before ui_items; buttons attach at paint)
ui_items.lua      # item buttons + grid groups (ns.Items contract)
ui_frame.lua      # the inventory window (consumes ns.Items; DaseekiUI-skinned)
# --- W4 (search / sort / options) --- pure engines + DaseekiUI settings page ---
search.lua        # D4 owned search matcher + live dim controller (both layouts)
sort.lua          # sort engine: pure move planner + throttled, verified executor
options.lua       # DaseekiUI settings page (Core-gated) + additive qualityBorders default
